# EAS reads this from the app directory; patterns cover nested monorepo paths too.
**/node_modules/
**/.runtime/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/.generated/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/credentials.json
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.mobileprovision
**/android/
**/ios/
**/.git/
**/.codex/
**/.agents/
